{"license":"CC-BY-4.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"CoDoSiS test files"},{"typeName":"alternativeTitle","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Test files generated for the project \"Combining Data on slavery in Surinam\" (CoDoSiS)"]},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"596151"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:170456"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"C.W. van Galen"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud University"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/326099050"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"T.B. Hermsen"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud University"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/425760529"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"H. van den Heuvel"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Radboud University"},"authorIdentifierScheme":{"typeName":"authorIdentifierScheme","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"DAI"},"authorIdentifier":{"typeName":"authorIdentifier","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"info:eu-repo\/dai\/nl\/136423701"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"RU  Radboud University"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>This data collection comprises a set of test files developed in the CoDoSiS project of the CLARIAH program.<br>The project ‘Combining Data on slavery in Surinam’ (CoDoSiS) aimed to develop a strategy to convert existing datasets on Surinam slavery into Linked Data by using the CLARIAH wp4-tool Cows and to combine them into one database network with relevant connections using the CLARIN-tool TICCL. This collection contains the test files that were used in the project.<\/p><p>The test files are subsets of the complete datasets of the complete registers focussed around the year 1846<br>and were used to test the two issues defined above in the CoDoSiS project.<\/p><p>Included in the collection are:<\/p><p>- Slavenregisters_Picturae_plantages_1846 (TICCL and LOD)<br>- Slavenregisters_Everaert_1846 (TICCL and LOD)<br>- Monsterrol_Catharina_Sophia_1846 (TICCL and LOD)<br>- Slavenregisters_Picturae_eigenaren_1846 (TICCL)<br>- Wijkregisters_Paramaribo_1846 (TICCL)<br>- Surinaamsche_almanak_plantages_1846 (LOD)<br>- Surinaamsche_almanak_personen_1846 (TICCL)<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"slavery"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"social history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Surinam"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"linked data"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1846"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2018-01-01"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2020-07-02"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2020-06-19"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Radboud University"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D64000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D30000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geesteswetenschappen"},{"lang":"en","value":"Humanities"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34000","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"Hi